  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "We are in the kitchen before school this morning. I help my father cook an egg in a pan. The pan is hot, so I stand back and watch. At the table, I use a knife to cut bread. My father helps me put butter on the warm bread. There is a full glass of milk beside my plate. We also have fresh juice for our breakfast today. I take a small bite and smile at my father. Our breakfast is ready, and we sit down together.",
    "textZh": "今天早上上學前，我們在廚房裡。我幫爸爸用平底鍋煎一顆蛋。平底鍋很熱，所以我退後站著觀看。我在桌邊用刀切麵包。爸爸幫我把奶油抹在溫熱的麵包上。我的盤子旁有一杯裝滿的牛奶。今天早餐還有新鮮果汁。我咬了一小口，對爸爸微笑。早餐準備好了，我們一起坐下。",
